// The game's user-facing name — location 1 of exactly 2.
//
// This value becomes the app's home-screen name (CFBundleDisplayName). The
// other location is Engine/Core/GameIdentity.swift, which serves code that
// wants to print or draw the name. Change BOTH when renaming the game;
// nothing else in the repo carries the name. The target, folder, scheme,
// product, asset catalog and database are all deliberately name-agnostic
// ("Mobile App", "game_title", "in_defense_of_history.sqlite") so a rename
// never touches project structure again.
GAME_DISPLAY_NAME = Liberty Line
